        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You tap into Corazal's innumerable senses to identify disturbances throughout the Verduran Forest."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You and Corazal successfully identify a flashpoint: an imminent event that could stoke distrust and unrest. You experience a sensory premonition of the event, can cast know the way as a 7th-rank cantrip to point toward the location, and know which Elder Oak is closest to it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As success, but the ritual heavily taxes your mind and body. You are "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and until the drained condition ends, you are also "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The ritual has no effect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The ritual has no effect beyond burning your mind with conflicting information. You are "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and until the drained condition ends, you are also stupefied 1 and have the Dubious Knowledge skill feat. Whenever you would decrease this drained value, the value does not decrease unless you succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "flat",
            "dc": 11
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      }
